I count 6 roles for expert and better in bare-handed
combat, but okay.  Looks like only Rogues and Samurai
can get to Expert in two-weapon combat, so that might
be a little bit of a stretch for the Convict.  Still,
even the Tourist can get to Skilled, so maybe I'll bump
it up to that level, at least.

