It is a fair point about too many spell skills.

I was thinking that divination fit because of e.g. magic
mapping, but I suppose it's a bit of a stretch.  Matter fits
better because of e.g. knock and dig, so I'd want to at
least keep that, although maybe bump it down to Basic.  I
don't see any spells on the Clerical list that seem fitting,
though.

